  "body": "A substantial family home with a clever layout, excellent separation of spaces and an impressive outdoor setting. Elevated in an established neighbourhood, and offering a level of flexibility that will appeal to growing families, those with teenagers or households needing room for extended family.\r\n\r\nHigh ceilings enhance the spacious open plan kitchen, dining and living area, with a large kitchen featuring engineered stone benchtops, gas cooking and dual ovens. Outdoors, an expansive north-facing deck wraps around the home, providing an excellent entertaining space surrounded by established gardens, creating plenty of privacy. Four double bedrooms are complemented by three bathrooms, including two ensuites. The master suite enjoys direct deck access and a large walk-in wardrobe, while the substantial downstairs bedroom, complete with its own entrance, walk-in wardrobe and ensuite, is an excellent option for extended family, teenagers or guests.\r\n\r\n* Elevated position in quiet Millwater neighbourhood\r\n* Four double bedrooms, all with excellent wardrobe storage\r\n* Three bathrooms, including two ensuites\r\n* Downstairs bedroom with own access, walk-in wardrobe and ensuite\r\n* Master suite with direct deck access, ensuite and large walk-in wardrobe\r\n* High ceilings and laminate flooring through the main living area\r\n* Ducted heating and cooling system throughout\r\n* Double blinds for additional privacy and light control\r\n* Double garage with additional off-street parking\r\n\r\nPositioned close to Millwater's schools, parks and local shopping amenities, with Orewa Beach a short drive away, this is a home offering space, privacy and flexibility for families of all stages. Our vendors are motivated to make their next move, presenting a great opportunity to secure this impressive Millwater home.\r\n\r\nWe work with all agents from day one!\r\n\r\nFor more information, please download the files within the link: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/NDEU",
